[{"verse":2,"text":"Damascus: Heb. Darmesek"},{"verse":4,"text":"his: Heb. which were his"},{"verse":8,"text":"huge: Heb. in abundance"},{"verse":9,"text":"to show himself: Or, strongly to hold with them, etc."},{"verse":10,"text":"oppressed: Heb. crushed"},{"verse":14,"text":"had made: Heb. digged"}]